			<div class="content" id="post-content-4823303">
									

<p>Thanks for your detailed explanation. I've got a better understanding of the myth now, but my question is how you plan on presenting this info? The initial concept hints at a discovery and possible exploration log, but what else? If you can outline briefly for us the various components of the article, that will help us visualise the flow of information better.</p>
<p>I also would personally avoid excessive / explicit references to other SCPs - far more effective to make the reference subtle and allow the readers to make the connection on their own.</p>
<p>You're close to a greenlight, for me at least. I'm impressed by your knowledge of mythology and right now it's more a matter of contextualising and presenting said info into a competent SCP narrative. Best of luck!</p>

